  "body": "**Blocked by:** #195\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #195; #197 is the next sequential slice of the `mail-live-sync` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nMaintain IDLE for Inbox and All Mail under account connection budget about 15. Renew before 29 minutes; TCP keepalive/socket timeout/hard cycle deadline; bounded reconnect. EXISTS/expunge/flag signal triggers early reconcile.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No direct Email mutation in callback.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Signal triggers early reconcile.\n- Renewal and connection cap hold.\n- Disconnect/silent timeout reconnects without leaks.\n- Periodic reconcile remains.\n",
